            {
              "text": "Taz 1Nya 16:34; 2Nya 5:13; 7:3; Zab 100:5; 106:1; 107:1;118:1; 136:1; Yer 33:11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Waliimba kwa kupokezana, wakimsifu na kumtukuza Mwenyezi-Mungu:",
